    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know the \"temporary\" thing. thats what everyone says. but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like the world has already made its decision about me. like i've been erased. how am i supposed to just \"navigate\" through being a nobody? there's no point in trying to fix something that's already gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
